        {
          "name": "Archer",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Patay, 18 June 1429",
      "narration": "Suddenly, the hunters became the hunted. In June, the French caught a retreating English force near a village called Patay.",
      "word_count": 20
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-23",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The tide turns",
      "start": 366,
      "duration": 17,
      "image": "images/shot-23.png",
      "background": "field",
      "camera": "shake",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Archer",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "walk"
        },
        {
          "name": "Archer",
          "expression": "surprised",
          "pose": "walk"
        },
        {
          "name": "French knight",
          "expression": "angry",
          "pose": "walk"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Remember those devastating English longbowmen from Agincourt? They needed time to hammer wooden stakes into the ground to stop a cavalry charge. This time, they didn't get it. French knights slammed into their lines before the archers were even set.",
      "word_count": 40
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-24",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The tide turns",
      "start": 383,
      "duration": 13,
      "image": "images/shot-24.png",
      "background": "parchment",
      "camera": "static",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "French knight",
          "expression": "smug",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Archer",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Agincourt in reverse",
      "narration": "The elite army that had crushed France at Agincourt was completely wiped out. Thousands of English soldiers fell, while the French lost barely a hundred. It was Agincourt in reverse.",
      "word_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-25",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The crown at Reims",
      "start": 396,
      "duration": 13,
      "image": "images/shot-25.png",
      "background": "river",
      "camera": "track left",
      "characters": [
        {
          "name": "Joan",
