          "expression": "neutral",
          "pose": "walk"
        },
        {
          "name": "French knight",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "walk"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "With the English on the run, Joan convinced Charles to attempt the unthinkable: march straight through enemy territory to Reims. Miraculously, city after city opened its gates without a fight.",
      "word_count": 30
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-26",
      "speaker": null,
      "section": "The crown at Reims",
      "start": 409,
      "duration": 13,
      "image": "images/shot-26.png",
