          "name": "English knight",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        },
        {
          "name": "Townsman",
          "expression": "closed",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": null,
      "narration": "Eyewitnesses wrote that the entire square wept—even battle-hardened English soldiers. One of the English king's own secretaries reportedly walked away in horror, muttering, \"We are lost. We have burned a saint.\"",
      "word_count": 31
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-38",
