          "name": "Joan",
          "expression": "determined",
          "pose": "stand"
        }
      ],
      "on_screen_text": "Saint Joan, 1920",
      "narration": "In 1920, the Catholic Church officially canonized her as Saint Joan of Arc. Today, she is a patron saint of France, and bronze statues of her riding into battle stand in towns across the country.",
      "word_count": 35
    },
    {
      "id": "shot-41",
